  "notes": "Input sockets are XLR/6.35 mm combo jacks (mic, line or instrument via the LINE/INST switch where present). Main outputs exist as XLR and as 6.35 mm TRS; the guide does not state the XLR gender, male is the usual convention for outputs. INSERT jacks are TRS send/return (100 \u03a9 send, 10 k\u03a9 return); the signal path through them is not modelled. MIDI IN/OUT are 5-pin DIN. Powered by the included adapter (DC IN, not listed) or USB. Routing: the MIX knob blends inputs with playback 1-2 on MAIN OUT; MONITOR A/B selects playback 1-2 or 3-4 for the headphones.",
